01:11:47.416 --> 01:11:54.160
LIFE AND LEGACY OF KAREN JEAN PIERCE, A WOMAN WHOSE PRESENCE

01:11:54.356 --> 01:11:58.930
BROUGHT LIGHT PURPOSE AND COMPASSION TO EVERYONE WHO

01:11:58.930 --> 01:12:02.293
KNEW HER. >> KAREN WAS BORN ON FEBRUARY

01:12:04.633 --> 01:12:10.633
4TH, 1947 RIGHT HERE IN SAN FRANCISCO, THE CITY SHE LOVED

01:12:10.705 --> 01:12:15.177
SO DEEPLY AND NEVER LEFT. FROM AN EARLY AGE IT WAS CLEAR

01:12:15.177 --> 01:12:19.248
SHE HAD BOTH A BRILLIANT MIND AND A GENEROUS HEART.

01:12:19.248 --> 01:12:24.480
>> SHE GRADUATED SUMMA LOWRY FROM SAN FRANCISCO STATE

01:12:25.187 --> 01:12:26.789
UNIVERSITY AND ONE WENT ON TO EARN HER LAW DEGREE FROM UC

01:12:26.789 --> 01:12:30.389
HASTINGS. KAREN'S TRUE CALLING WAS ALWAYS

01:12:33.661 --> 01:12:36.661
ABOUT PEOPLE ESPECIALLY CHILDREN FAMILIES

01:12:37.265 --> 01:12:41.465
AND COMMUNITIES THAT TOO OFTEN GO FORGOTTEN.

01:12:41.603 --> 01:12:45.407
FOR MORE THAN 20 YEARS. SHE SERVED AT SAN FRANCISCO

01:12:45.407 --> 01:12:49.678
DEPARTMENT OF PUBLIC HEALTH WHERE SHE BECAME THE

01:12:49.678 --> 01:12:53.415
DEPARTMENT'S FIRST AND ONLY ENVIRONMENTAL JUSTICE MANAGER.

01:12:53.415 --> 01:12:57.753
THAT TITLE ALONE TELLS YOU SOMETHING ABOUT HER SPIRIT

01:12:57.753 --> 01:13:01.890
AND SHE DID NOT WAIT FOR PATHS TO BE PAVED.

01:13:01.890 --> 01:13:05.360
SHE CREATED THEM THROUGH HER WORK.

01:13:05.360 --> 01:13:10.760
SHE FOUGHT FOR CLEAN AIR, SAFER NEIGHBORHOODS, GREATER EQUITY

01:13:11.833 --> 01:13:14.833
PARTICULARLY IN BAYVIEW HUNTERS POINT.

01:13:15.437 --> 01:13:18.907
SHE LISTENED DEEPLY, SPOKE TRUTH TO POWER AND TURNED

01:13:18.907 --> 01:13:23.846
ADVOCACY INTO ACTION. >> THE IMPACT OF HER WORK STILL

01:13:23.846 --> 01:13:29.846
RIPPLES THROUGH THIS CITY AND WILL FOR YEARS TO COME.

01:13:30.886 --> 01:13:32.388
BEYOND HER PROFESSIONAL ACHIEVEMENTS, KAREN LIVED WITH

01:13:32.388 --> 01:13:37.788
BALANCE AND WITH JOY. SHE LOVED THE GOOD BOOK.

01:13:38.326 --> 01:13:42.197
THE CHALLENGE OF A THOUSAND PIECE PUZZLE AND THE SMELL OF

01:13:42.197 --> 01:13:45.797
SOMETHING HOMEMADE BAKING IN THE OVEN.

01:13:45.801 --> 01:13:49.817
>> SHE ALSO HAD AN ADVENTUROUS SIDE COMPLETING THREE MARATHONS

01:13:49.817 --> 01:13:55.489
AFTER THE AGE OF 15 WITH RACES THAT TOOK HER TO BERMUDA,

01:13:55.489 --> 01:14:00.161
HAWAII AND EVEN ALASKA. >> THAT SAME DETERMINATION THAT

01:14:00.161 --> 01:14:06.161
FUELED HER ADVOCACY CARRIED HER ACROSS FINISH LINES MOST WOULD

01:14:06.967 --> 01:14:10.904
NEVER ATTEMPT. THOSE WHO KNEW KAREN DESCRIBED

01:14:10.904 --> 01:14:15.642
HER AS STRONG BUT GENTLE. SERIOUS WHEN IT MATTERED BUT

01:14:15.642 --> 01:14:19.242
QUICK TO SMILE. DEEPLY COMPASSIONATE YET

01:14:19.579 --> 01:14:26.179
UNWAVERING IN HER PRINCIPLES. SHE WAS A LISTENER, A MENTOR, A

01:14:27.321 --> 01:14:33.321
FIGHTER FOR WHAT'S RIGHT. >> AND ABOVE ALL, SHE WAS KIND.

01:14:33.994 --> 01:14:38.532
HER LIFE REMINDS US THAT CHANGE DOESN'T ALWAYS COME FROM LOUD

01:14:38.532 --> 01:14:42.200
VOICES. OUR BIG GESTURES ALTHOUGH SHE

01:14:42.200 --> 01:14:46.730
ALWAYS GOT OUR POINT MADE SOMETIMES IT COMES FROM QUIET

01:14:46.730 --> 01:14:51.473
STRENGTH, STEADY PERSISTENCE AND A HEART THAT REFUSES TO

01:14:53.414 --> 01:14:57.217
GIVE UP ON PEOPLE. >> ALTHOUGH KAREN HAS LEFT THIS

01:14:57.217 --> 01:15:01.688
WORLD HER IMPACT ON HER FAMILY, HER COMMUNITY INNER CITY WILL

01:15:01.688 --> 01:15:05.759
CONTINUE TO GROW. MAY WE HONOR HER BY LIVING WITH

01:15:05.759 --> 01:15:09.963
THAT SAME PURPOSE AND GRACE AND EVERYONE HERE THAT'S HERE

01:15:09.963 --> 01:15:14.100
IN SUPPORT OF KAREN. >> COULD YOU JUST STAND SO WE

01:15:14.100 --> 01:15:18.900
COULD SEE? THANK YOU FOR BEING HERE TO

01:15:35.522 --> 01:15:39.593
HONOR HER COLLEAGUES AND ALSO INTRODUCING A RESOLUTION A

01:15:39.593 --> 01:15:43.193
RESOLUTION CALLING FOR MOTORIZED SCOOTER ENFORCEMENT

01:15:43.664 --> 01:15:47.735
ON SIDEWALKS IN ORDER TO PROTECT PROTEST TRENDS AND KEEP

01:15:47.735 --> 01:15:51.335
PEOPLE SAFE. >> OUR SIDEWALKS ARE WHERE

01:15:51.538 --> 01:15:55.476
EVERYONE WALKS WHETHER IT'S SENIORS, CHILDREN, FAMILIES,

01:15:55.476 --> 01:15:59.676
PEOPLE WITH DISABILITIES AND NEIGHBORS MOVING THROUGH

01:15:59.879 --> 01:16:01.140
THEIR COMMUNITY. THEY ARE MEANT TO BE SAFE,

01:16:01.140 --> 01:16:05.814
PREDICTABLE SPACES FOR PEDESTRIANS NOT SHARE WITH FAST

01:16:06.953 --> 01:16:10.491
MOVING ELECTRIC OR GAS POWERED SCOOTERS.

01:16:10.491 --> 01:16:15.162
RIDING SCOOTERS ON SIDEWALKS IS NOT ONLY ILLEGAL, IT IS

01:16:15.162 --> 01:16:18.632
DANGEROUS AND IT UNDERMINES A SENSE OF SAFETY THAT EVERY

01:16:18.632 --> 01:16:21.902
PERSON DESERVES. WALKING IN SAN FRANCISCO UNDER

01:16:21.902 --> 01:16:26.702
CALIFORNIA VEHICLE CODE AND SAN FRANCISCO TRANSPORTATION CODE

01:16:27.107 --> 01:16:30.710
IT IS ALREADY PROHIBITED TO RIDE SCOOTERS ON SIDEWALKS.

01:16:30.710 --> 01:16:34.915
YET WE CONTINUE TO SEE RIDERS TREATING SIDEWALKS LIKE

01:16:34.915 --> 01:16:38.510
THOROUGH WAYS OFTEN AT HIGH SPEEDS.

01:16:38.510 --> 01:16:42.256
THIS BEHAVIOR PUTS PEDESTRIANS AT SERIOUS RISK AND GOES

01:16:42.256 --> 01:16:47.656
AGAINST THE CORE PRINCIPLES OF OUR CITY'S VISION ZERO

01:16:47.928 --> 01:16:50.928
COMMITMENT. >> A DISTRICT TEN RESIDENT

01:16:51.598 --> 01:16:55.202
RECENTLY WROTE ABOUT HER 84 YEAR OLD FATHER WHO IS UNSTEADY

01:16:55.202 --> 01:16:58.739
ON HIS FEET. A SCOOTER DOESN'T EVEN HAVE TO

01:16:58.739 --> 01:17:01.875
HIT HIM. THE SHOCK OF ONE ZOOMING BY

01:17:01.875 --> 01:17:05.679
COULD CAUSE HIM TO FALL WITH SERIOUS CONSEQUENCES FOR HIS

01:17:05.679 --> 01:17:09.282
HEALTH. MANY OF US HAVE FAMILY OR

01:17:09.282 --> 01:17:14.682
COMMUNITY MEMBERS IN THE SAME POSITION OUR ELDERS, CHILDREN

01:17:16.157 --> 01:17:20.160
AND PEOPLE WITH DISABILITIES DESERVE SIDEWALKS THAT FEEL

01:17:20.160 --> 01:17:24.360
SAFE AND WALKABLE. NOT STRESSFUL OR FRIGHTENING.

01:17:24.498 --> 01:17:28.569
>> WHILE IT'S A FORM TO REGULATE SHARED SCOOTERS, WE

01:17:28.569 --> 01:17:32.105
HAVE SEEN A RAPID INCREASE IN PRIVATELY OWNED SCOOTERS.

01:17:32.105 --> 01:17:36.905
AND ENFORCEMENT OF THESE VIOLATIONS DEPENDS ON SPEEDY.

01:17:38.846 --> 01:17:42.450
THIS RESOLUTION CALLS FOR STRONGER COORDINATION BETWEEN

01:17:42.450 --> 01:17:46.920
S.F. MTA AND SPEEDY TO TREAT SIDEWALKS SCOOTER RIDING AS THE

01:17:46.920 --> 01:17:52.920
MOVE IN VIOLATION THAT IT IS AND TO PRIORITIZE ENFORCEMENT

01:17:53.461 --> 01:17:58.650
AND EDUCATION IN HIGH PEDESTRIAN AREAS SUCH AS

01:17:58.650 --> 01:18:01.802
COMMERCIAL CORRIDORS, SENIOR CENTERS AND SCHOOL SCHOOL

01:18:01.802 --> 01:18:04.939
ZONES. >> IT ALSO CALLS FOR CLEAR

01:18:04.939 --> 01:18:09.276
