01:18:09.276 --> 01:18:13.147
AND FOR RESIDENTS TO CONTINUE REPORTING VIOLATIONS THROUGH

01:18:13.147 --> 01:18:16.147
311 TO HELP GUIDE ENFORCEMENT RESOURCES.

01:18:16.750 --> 01:18:20.350
>> EVERYONE RIDERS, DRIVERS AND PEDESTRIANS SHARE

01:18:21.354 --> 01:18:24.425
RESPONSIBILITY FOR KEEPING OUR CITY SAFE.

01:18:24.425 --> 01:18:28.562
